# Legends Empire

Multi-agent Obsidian wiki skill pack (Karpathy LLM Wiki). Brand name across Cursor, Grok, Codex, Claude, Gemini: **Legends Empire** (not Codex Empire).

## What This Project Is

- **Skill pack root**: `skills/<name>/SKILL.md` (Agent Skills format)
- **Demo vault**: `wiki/` + `.raw/`
- **User vault**: explicitly selected directory, never this product checkout
- **Matrix**: `docs/AGENTS-MATRIX.md`

## Skills

When the user says Legends Empire, wiki, ingest, query, lint, save, canvas, or research, read the matching `skills/<name>/SKILL.md`.

Brand entry: `legends-empire` → orchestrator `wiki`.
